stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Create order and reserve stock
    PENDING --> CONFIRMED: SUCCESS payment; consume stock
    PENDING --> FAILED: FAILED payment; release reservation
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: Customer cancels; release reservation
    PENDING --> EXPIRED: Eligible unpaid order expires; release reservation
    note right of PENDING
      Pending or successful payments are not expired blindly.
      Reconciliation applies known simulated provider outcomes.
    end note
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
